      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im texting u. everything just feels so empty. like i walk into the student lounge or the library and i can see people looking right through me. it’s like i died or something but im still stuck walking around. everyone knows what happened and they just... stopped. it's like i don't even exist anymore. i feel like a ghost.",
